{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Facial Yoga》是一款專為改善臉部線條、放鬆臉部肌肉設計的智能 App，它能協助使用者從居家環境輕鬆打造更緊緻、健康的臉部輪廓，今天更限時免費開放終生版。這款應用程式非常適合那些希望改善臉部姿勢、減少浮腫、放鬆緊繃肌肉，或是單純追求更清晰下顎線條的所有人，讓臉部瑜伽變得簡單、有效且令人愉悅。</p>\n\n<h2>專業指導居家輕鬆練習</h2>\n<p>《Facial Yoga》以科學方法引導臉部瑜伽及下顎線條訓練，旨在強化臉部肌肉，改善輪廓並減少張力。應用內含清晰動畫指引，無論身在何處，皆可無設備輕鬆練習，助您建立健康的臉部姿勢，擁有更自信煥發的容顏。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-146-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-147-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-148-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-149-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-150-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1242x2688bb-151-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Facial Yoga: Jawline Exercises 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，按右上方的 Promo Code 輸入欄，然後輸入 “face”，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 3386\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/IMG_3386-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 3388\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/IMG_3388-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Facial Yoga: Jawline Exercises</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-22T22:47:58.767663+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":462,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}